# Viewport UI verify

MCP `screen_capture` sees the 3D viewport only. Dock widgets and CoreGui do not appear.

- Verify UI by mounting stories into `StarterGui.StorybloxViewport` via `storyblox-viewport*` attributes on `ServerStorage.StorybloxPlugin.stories`, then `screen_capture`, then check `storyblox-viewport-error` / stats.
- Never claim dock screenshot proof.
- Skill: `storyblox-viewport-test`.
